OL,3,GNEWSADad calls for 'crisis' education
OL,4,Ato reduce suicide among men and boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father whose son died by suicide on
OL,7,Fthe day after his 22nd birthday has
OL,8,Fcalled for more education on how men
OL,9,Fand boys can seek help during a mental
OL,10,Fhealth crisis.
OL,12,FSeamus Waites said there was "no
OL,13,Fwarning sign whatsoever" before his son
OL,14,FThomas took his own life in May 2016,
OL,15,Fjust hours after he went out to
OL,16,Fcelebrate with friends.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
