OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad calls for 'crisis' education
OL,4,Ato reduce suicide among men and boys
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaites, who has since become a grief
OL,7,Fcounsellor, said when men reach crisis
OL,8,Fpoint they "do not understand the
OL,9,Femotions that they're feeling, they
OL,10,Fbecome totally overwhelmed and don't
OL,11,Fknow where to go".
OL,13,FSuicide remains the leading cause of
OL,14,Fdeath for boys and men aged under 50 in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland - of the 262 people
OL,16,Fwho took their own lives last year, 203
OL,17,Fwere male.
